      <div class="swingvasion-box schedule-full">
        <div class="swingvasion-details">
          <div class="m-4">
            <h3 class="p-0 mt-4">Auditions</h3>
            <p class="small">
              We know not everyone likes to compete, or gets the chance to very
              often, so we will be holding auditions to allow everyone the
              chance to join our level-restricted workshops.
            </p>
            <p class="small">
              Auditions will be held at 10:30 on Saturday morning - dancers will
              have the chance to audition to join the Intermediate+ or Advanced+
              workshop streams.
            </p>
            <p class="small">
              Auditions will run a bit like a Jack and Jill. You’ll have a few
              songs to dance and rotate around your group, while our pro staff
              will be selecting those who can attend the higher-levelled
              workshop.
            </p>
            <p class="small">
              If you’re not sure whether to audition, have a think about what
              impact getting a “no” will have on the rest of your event
              experience - if you think it’s likely to have a negative effect,
              we’d recommend skipping the audition and enjoying the rest of the
              event!
            </p>

            <h3 class="p-0 mt-4">Workshop Levels</h3>
            <table class="sheets-html-table schedule-table levels-table">
              <thead>
                <tr>
                  <th>Level</th>
                  <th>Description</th>
                </tr>
              </thead>
              <tbody>
                <tr>
                  <td class="level-newcomers">Newcomers</td>
                  <td>
                    Targeted at those who have been dancing less than a year but
                    open to all.
                  </td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                  <td class="level-open">Open</td>
                  <td>
                    Open to all levels of dancers. Content will be targeted to
                    suit a range of experience levels.
                  </td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                  <td class="level-extension">Extension</td>
                  <td>
                    Intended to challenge more experienced dancers, who must be
                    comfortable with anchor variations, rhythm changes, rock &
                    gos and hitches, and be able to apply these consistently in
                    their social dancing. As a general benchmark, dancers who
                    are finalling in Novice should be well suited to this level.
                  </td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                  <td class="level-intermediate">Intermediate+</td>
                  <td>
                    For dancers eligible to dance in the WSDC Intermediate
                    division and above.
                  </td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                  <td class="level-advanced">Advanced+</td>
                  <td>
                    For dancers eligible to dance in the WSDC Advanced division
                    and above.
                  </td>
                </tr>
              </tbody>
            </table>

            <img
              src="/images/Levels.png"
              alt="Workshop Levels"
              class="levels-image"
            />

